    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just don't want to deal with the cost of an urgent care visit if i don't have to. i've had infections before and they always went away with just some ointment and rest. is there any way i can just tell if it's actually serious or if it's just a normal reaction? like, if the red line stays the same size and i just take some more advil, could i just monitor it at home tonight and see how it looks in the morning?",
